\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 ##High-end market
\f2\b\fs24 \

\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 \
In the high-end market, a pencil skirt is constructed as a meticulously crafted garment that carries conceptual meaning as much as sartorial savoir-faire. Designers and their ateliers explore lines, movement, silhouette, proportion, and knowledge through a pencil skirt.\
\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	\'95	}Sophisticated media\strokec2 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl1\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Luxury materials such as high-end leather, silk, wool, and cotton.\strokec2 \
\ls7\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Details in high-quality brass, high-quality zippers, and well-thought pockets and slits.\strokec2 \
\ls7\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 The choice of materials, such as leather in many Saint Laurent skirts, go hand-in-hand with the designer\'92s vision of movement and shape. (i.e. leather gives a sturdier silhouette)\strokec2 \
\ls7\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf2 \strokec4 {\listtext	\'95	}Architectural tailoring\strokec2 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl1\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Precise dart manipulation to sculpt the hips and waist\strokec2 \
\ls7\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Structured waists, shaped hems, and clean slits\strokec2 \
\ls7\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 The construction is almost sculptural, contouring the body.\strokec2 \
\ls7\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Deep knowledge of proportions and movement of the wearer.\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf2 \strokec4 {\listtext	\'95	}Intention in design\strokec2 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl1\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Other designers, such as Comme Des Gar\'e7ons, distort the shape of a pencil skirt to push the boundaries of design \'96 avant-garde style.\strokec2 \
\ls8\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Saint Laurent focuses on the founder Yves Saint Laurent\'92s idea of feminine elegance and shape. Each garment, each skirt echoes a bold and sculptural ideal in the construction, the materials, and the design.\strokec2 \
\ls8\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Saint Laurent uses garments such as le smoking, blazers in general, coats, pants, and skirts to communicate their own sense of refinement, empowerment, and feminine \'93values.\'94\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf2 \strokec4 {\listtext	\'95	}Limited production and hand finishings\strokec2 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl1\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Hand-placed waistbands\strokec2 \
\ls9\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Couture-level pressing, shaping, and lining\strokec2 \
\ls9\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Slow, detailed manufacturing, mostly produced in Italy\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \cb1 \strokec2 \
\
\
\
\
Saint Laurent\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 T\strokec4 his skirt sits at the natural waist, in a midi length made with top grain lamb leather. Overall, top grain leather is considered to be the top category as the grain is more sophisticated, less chemically treated, and the dermis is preserved.Lamb leather is supple, giving the skirt a type of structure and shape, with enough flexibility for movement.\
\strokec2 \
\strokec4 The visible vertical panel seams suggest intentional geometric construction and careful use of leather hides\'97typical of high-end maisons. The finish is clean, with a simple waistband and no visible hardware, except for the zipper in the back, reinforcing a minimalist idea of elegance.\cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx566\tx1133\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \

\fs28 ##Mass Market
\fs24 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 In contrast, mass-market pencil skirts are grounded in affordability, comfort, and broad usability. The silhouette is simplified to allow large-scale production and consistent, standard fit across many body types depending on the target market.\
\
\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf2 \strokec4 {\listtext	\'95	}Cost-efficient materials\strokec2 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl1\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Mostly crafted from a polyester base \'96 cost-effective and versatile material\strokec2 \
\ls10\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Easy fit with a lightweight feeling\strokec2 \
\ls10\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Usually, Zara pencil skirts include a coating, a print, or some sort of decoration to present a mass-attractive choice\strokec2 \
\ls10\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec4 Polyurethane is widely used in faux-leather products, which are currently in high-demand\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0\cf2 \strokec4 {\listtext	\'95	}Streamline production processes\strokec2 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl1\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
